  - _title: Progression & Economy
    _steps:
    - _description: Dual Currency System - Coins (common) + Gems (premium)
      _image: {fileID: 0}
    - _description: Upgrade System - Permanent stat upgrades purchased with gems.
        Boost base damage, health, critical chance, armor, dodge, and movement speed
        across all future runs. Stack upgrades for exponential power growth.
      _image: {fileID: 0}
    - _description: Shop System - Buy weapons, equipment, consumables with coins
      _image: {fileID: 0}
    - _description: Reroll Mechanic - Refresh shop inventory for a coin cost
      _image: {fileID: 0}
    - _description: Equipment Boost System - 20+ items across 4 rarity tiers for
        stat bonuses
      _image: {fileID: 0}
    - _description: Weapon Recycling - Convert weapons to coins (50% refund
      _image: {fileID: 0}
    - _description: Chest Drop System - Random loot drops with configurable rates
      _image: {fileID: 0}
  - _title: Waves & Enemies
    _steps:
    - _description: Progressive Difficulty - Each wave harder with more enemies
      _image: {fileID: 0}
    - _description: Boss Encounters - Special waves with powerful boss enemies
      _image: {fileID: 0}
    - _description: Enemy Variety - Light Melee, Heavy Armored, Ranged Attackers
      _image: {fileID: 0}
    - _description: Endless Mode - Infinite waves after wave 15 with scaling difficulty
      _image: {fileID: 0}
    - _description: Wave Transition System - Safe period between waves to shop and
        prepare
      _image: {fileID: 0}
    - _description: "Map Theme Changes - Environments evolve: Plains \u2192 Forest
        \u2192 Desert \u2192 Hell"
      _image: {fileID: 0}
